      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تبرّر</span></b>  [<i>He affected,</i> or <i>endeavoured to characterize himself by,</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِرّ</span>, i. e. <i>filial piety,</i> &amp;c.]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَدْ تَبَرَّرْتَ فِى أَمْرِنَا</span> <i>Thou hast abstained from
crime,</i> or <i>sin,</i> or <i>the like, in our affair,</i> or <i>business,</i>
or <i>case.</i> (T, TA.) ＝   
